<title>USA: Sioux City hogs up $0.25/0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs up $0.25/0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.25 to $0.50 higher. Trade moderate. Top $61.75 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3   220-270 lbs     61.50-61.75</p>
<p>	   270-280 lbs     60.50-61.50</p>
<p>US 2-3   280-300 lbs     59.00-60.00</p>
<p>US 3-4   300-330 lbs     55.50-58.50</p>
<p>Sows: scarce</p>
</text>
